# Everything the build stage does not need.
#
# The multi-stage Dockerfile keeps build layers out of the final image, but
# layers carry, cache and travel. Secrets must never even ENTER the build
# context — so .env (Groq / Gemini / Telegram credentials) is banned here.

.env
.env.*
*.session*

bin/
coverage.out
coverage.html

.git
.github
docs/
*.md
